      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "What is collection\n================\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "What is collection\n================\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "mUtL3k67Gih_uVe-qEiHO",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 249,
      "y": 185,
      "width": 901,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a2",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1568905735,
      "version": 301,
      "versionNonce": 1484772041,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1782196826520,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Collection is a group of objects which are stored as single objects and allows us to perform\nvarious operations on them such as add, delete, search ,print and sort.\n\n\nBut before first diving into collection we need to understand drawbacks of Arrays.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Collection is a group of objects which are stored as single objects and allows us to perform\nvarious operations on them such as add, delete, search ,print and sort.\n\n\nBut before first diving into collection we need to understand drawbacks of Arrays.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "rRQ4YOu6-vLHYz5XlbDVv",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 249,
      "y": 362,
      "width": 816,
      "height": 250,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a3",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 505312393,
      "version": 285,
      "versionNonce": 1670008521,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1782197579396,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Drawbacks of Array in java\n==================\n\n1. Size is must\n\n2.fixed size in nature\n\n3. Stores only homogenous data.\n\n4. It doest have any predefined methods add, delete ,seach and sort the elements",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Drawbacks of Array in java\n==================\n\n1. Size is must\n\n2.fixed size in nature\n\n3. Stores only homogenous data.\n\n4. It doest have any predefined methods add, delete ,seach and sort the elements",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "QUkK8ybwu29GIwnaaraa0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 253,
      "y": 643,
      "width": 874,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
