      "updated": 1782197996338,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Advantages of Collections\n========================\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Advantages of Collections\n========================\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Zxn7nk0Cx3w51Kz6jlN2f",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 301,
      "y": 962,
      "width": 998,
      "height": 325,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a6",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 957271687,
      "version": 526,
      "versionNonce": 1644515143,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1782199481035,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. They do not require size by programmer.\n\n2. They have dynamic size.\n\n3. They allow hetrogeous data to be stored. But as a developer we never use hetrogenous collection.\n\n4. They have predefines methods to perform CRUD operations.\n\nEven they have methods for SEARCHING , SORTING ETC.\n\n\n\nArray                                                                                     Collection",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. They do not require size by programmer.\n\n2. They have dynamic size.\n\n3. They allow hetrogeous data to be stored. But as a developer we never use hetrogenous collection.\n\n4. They have predefines methods to perform CRUD operations.\n\nEven they have methods for SEARCHING , SORTING ETC.\n\n\n\nArray                                                                                     Collection",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
