      "updated": 1782200001579,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Size is required                                                            no size required at time of creation.\n\n\n2. Fixed in size means at run time we can not add more             Growable in nature. \n   data\n\n3. only stores homogenous data.                                          Can store homogeneous as well as \n                                                                                  hetrogeneous data.\n\n\n4. No predefined method for operations                                  various predefined metehods for \n                                                                                  operations.\n\n5. We can store primitive as well as no primitive data.                 Collection only stores non-primitive data                                 ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
